// transparency (D2) / safety_and_robustness (D3) / fairness_and_human_oversight
// (D4); deprecated v1 aliases accepted via imda.Canonicalise() — the proto
// enum carries ONLY canonical labels because servers persist canonical form.
//
// Append-only invariant: AuditEvent is append-only — NO UpdateAuditEvent /
// DeleteAuditEvent RPC by design; gRPC reads only.
